IMPLEMENTATION STRATEGY
Work in phases.
Start by scaffolding the monorepo, backend, frontend, Docker, database config, and base schemas.
Then implement market data ingestion.
Then implement indicators and screening.
Then add news/context.
Then add scoring/explanations.
Then add research lab and paper trading.
At each phase:
- create clean commits
- write/update tests
- update docs
- keep the app runnable

